{"id":"n55525-1-7","stage":1,"title":"메모 · 记录","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55525-1-7-1","ko":"어머니를 좀 바꿔 주겠어요?","zh":"能帮我换一下电话给妈妈吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니를","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니를","audio":"/audio/764b0fa53b4990f1e0d6.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"바꿔","meaning":"换人接电话，转接","explanation":"바꾸다：换人接电话，转接；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"4","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바꿔","audio":"/audio/aaf9f253fd04921d1f86.mp3"}},{"text":"주겠어요?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주겠어요","audio":"/audio/80f7e9a0dcd2f8439d98.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"5cc3393b01c955d1","term":"바꾸다","zh":"换人接电话，转接","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3","entryId":"17198","definition":"打电话时把电话转给别人或